        "text": "1 + e / (1 + e)",
        "color": "#ffc854"
      },
      {
        "text": ", where e is your Fruit Efficiency. The normal curve never reaches 2x; this one keeps growing. Rot chance is unchanged."
      },
      {
        "text": "\n\nExamples: +50% efficiency gives 1.71x time instead of 1.33x, +150% gives 2.22x instead of 1.60x, +300% gives 2.73x instead of 1.75x."
      }
